          "children": [
            {
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Watch is in overall near-mint condition. The DLC-coated steel case shows light signs of careful wear, with a few pin-prick marks to the coating mainly visible from the rear. The dial and hands remain like new. It is fitted with a rubber strap and a steel deployant clasp, both remaining in near-mint condition. Comes complete with inner and outer boxes, warranty card and tool.",
              "_key": "ac9d40447b48",
              "_type": "span"
            }
          ],
          "_type": "block"
        }
      ],
      "_key": "6985ad09d93a",
